fbb5fbe2-16ad-4cf4-af7d-ff9d9c316c87	1.0.0	https://docs.airbyte.com/integrations/sources/sendgrid-migrations#1.0.0	2024-04-29	This release makes several changes that upgrade the Sendgrid connector. The configuration options have been renamed to `api_key` and `start_date`. `start_date` is now required. The `unsubscribe_groups` stream has been removed. It was the same as `suppression_groups`. You can use that and get the same data. The `single_sends` stream has been renamed `singlesend_stats`. This is closer to the data and API. The `segments` stream has been upgraded to use the Sendgrid 2.0 API because the older one has been deprecated. The schema has changed as a result. To ensure a smooth upgrade, please refresh your schemas and reset your data before resuming syncs.	2026-03-29 06:57:51.577071+00	2026-03-29 06:57:51.577071+00	[]
